From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jamie Nguyen <jamien@nvidia.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 12:19:46 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] NVIDIA: SAUCE: selftests/bpf: Match 7.0 verifier message for
 negative buffer offsets

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2170741

Commit afcd1512a0c3 backported upstream selftest 6f59deb32efa without
its kernel change fd4cfa8c8f9a. That change fixes 022ac0750883, which is
not in 7.0. The tests expect "invalid negative %s buffer offset", a
message added by fd4cfa8c8f9a. The 7.0 verifier rejects the same access
with "invalid %s buffer access: off=%d, size=%d", so the tests fail.

Match the 7.0 message. The tests still check that the load is rejected.

Fixes: afcd1512a0c3 ("selftests/bpf: Cover negative buffer pointer offsets")
Signed-off-by: Jamie Nguyen <jamien@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Matthew R. Ochs <mochs@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Carol L Soto <csoto@nvidia.com>
Signed-off-by: Brad Figg <bfigg@nvidia.com>
Ledger-Change: C-02226
Ledger-Origin: nvidia-bos@a94750380fa1f6e3e602ea17fe5cf8df04e895ef
---
 tools/testing/selftests/bpf/progs/verifier_ptr_to_buf.c      | 2 +-
 tools/testing/selftests/bpf/progs/verifier_raw_tp_writable.c | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/testing/selftests/bpf/progs/verifier_ptr_to_buf.c b/tools/testing/selftests/bpf/progs/verifier_ptr_to_buf.c
index 12cf24db46a0..a43ea0963455 100644
--- a/tools/testing/selftests/bpf/progs/verifier_ptr_to_buf.c
+++ b/tools/testing/selftests/bpf/progs/verifier_ptr_to_buf.c
@@ -7,7 +7,7 @@
 SEC("iter/bpf_map_elem")
 __description("PTR_TO_BUF: reject negative const offset")
 __failure
-__msg("invalid negative rdwr buffer offset")
+__msg("R2 invalid rdwr buffer access: off=-8, size=8")
 __naked void ptr_to_buf_reject_negative_const_offset(void)
 {
 	asm volatile ("r0 = 0;					\
diff --git a/tools/testing/selftests/bpf/progs/verifier_raw_tp_writable.c b/tools/testing/selftests/bpf/progs/verifier_raw_tp_writable.c
index 4055a6443bc2..015d56c0f781 100644
--- a/tools/testing/selftests/bpf/progs/verifier_raw_tp_writable.c
+++ b/tools/testing/selftests/bpf/progs/verifier_raw_tp_writable.c
@@ -50,7 +50,7 @@ l0_%=:	/* shift the buffer pointer to a variable location */\
 SEC("raw_tracepoint.w")
 __description("raw_tracepoint_writable: reject negative const offset")
 __failure
-__msg("invalid negative tracepoint buffer offset")
+__msg("R6 invalid tracepoint buffer access: off=-8, size=8")
 __naked void tracepoint_writable_reject_negative_const_offset(void)
 {
 	asm volatile ("					\
